# Sonance — .gitignore
#
# Created 2026-09-03 (v3.9 Session 1) with one job: keep the Navidrome test
# account credentials, and the per-session working files, out of version
# control. The repository itself was created at v3.11 (2026-10-07).
#
# Kept deliberately narrow; what is tracked on purpose is listed at the bottom.

# --- Credentials and local-only working files -------------------------------
# TEST-ACCOUNT.local.md is the single store for the Navidrome test account.
*.local.md
.env
.env.*

# Per-session chained prompt, regenerated by every session. Its PART D carries
# environment state including the path to the credential file.
next_prompt.md

# PROGRESS.md is deliberately ignored — it is the project's history and the
# only durable record of what each session did. It must never contain
# credentials; reference TEST-ACCOUNT.local.md by path instead. Its private to us.
PROGRESS.md

# April 2026 Playwright MCP output: holds replayable Subsonic t/s login pairs
# and a login-form snapshot with the test password (v3.10 S8 audit, report §7).
.playwright-mcp/

# Screenshots: every subfolder (session captures, test output, and any folder
# added later) stays local; files directly in screenshots/ are the images the
# GitHub page uses and are tracked. Some old captures show the test account.
screenshots/*/

# --- OS noise ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# instructions for andy to push to github
GIT_INSTRUCTIONS.md

# --- Proposed by Session 1; settled at v3.11 ----------------------------------
# Tracked on purpose: the two release packages (Sonance3.wgt,
# Sonance3-Oblong.wgt) and the bundles the shipped index.html loads
# (js/sonance-*.min.js). screenshots/ subfolders and .playwright-mcp/ are
# ignored above; the loose root PNGs were tidied away by the user.

# Playwright
node_modules/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/
/playwright/.auth/
